  },
  "1465357625": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 542479325,
   "actor": "Clay",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Hah. That’s… brilliant. You gave her what she wanted without losing what’s ours. That’s balance.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "520393068": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 542479325,
   "actor": "Clay",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You actually impressed me. And that doesn’t happen often.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-429285771": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 542479325,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Ohhh wow! You’re amazing! I thought for sure you’d either sell us out or say no, but you… you found a way to win both sides!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1545525832": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 542479325,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Moo-power AND brain-power! We’re unstoppable now!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-23342068": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 542479325,
   "actor": "Clay",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Don’t say moo-power. But… she’s right. You did good. Better than I ever could’ve managed.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1309264087": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1833861905,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "This is our farm, and it’s gonna shine brighter than ever!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1011405257": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1833861905,
   "actor": "Clay",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Hah… shine? Without her money, we’re just back to scraping by.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "448027700": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1833861905,
   "actor": "Clay",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You turned down security, and for what? Pride? Hope? Both of those die faster than cows out here.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1954724567": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1833861905,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Can't you just be happy for once!? I trust {PC}! You should too!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-956971138": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1833861905,
   "actor": "Clay",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "…We’ll see, sure. I’m not holding my breath.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1872652288": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1015196123,
   "actor": "Clay",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "For the first time in years… I feel like we might actually be safe.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "356590333": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1015196123,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Safe?! This isn’t safe, it’s awful! You sold us out to that scary rich lady!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1990311314": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1015196123,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "This was supposed to be our thing, not hers!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1919315240": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1015196123,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I can’t do this. Not like this. If this is what the farm’s become, then it’s not my home anymore.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
   "onFinish": [
    {
     "kind": "setActive",
     "type": "InstructionGameObjectSetActive",
     "title": "Set Active Leave to True",
     "fields": {
      "m_Active": {
       "kind": "value",
       "value": true
      },
      "m_GameObject": {
       "kind": "object",
       "name": "Leave",
       "of": "GetGameObjectInstance",
       "path": "2_Bust_Manager/KirbyBustDefault/MBase1/Leave"
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "-1761323811": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1015196123,
   "actor": "Clay",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "…Let her go. She’s always been stubborn, always chasing dreams that don’t exist.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1020718137": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1015196123,
   "actor": "Clay",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "But me? I’m… grateful. You gave me something I thought I’d never see again: stability.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1361513692": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1015196123,
   "actor": "Clay",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I'm sure Kirby will return in time, maybe she needs a year or two away from all this.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-93624987": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1833861905,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Shut up, Clay! You’ll never understand! We’ll make it work, even if we have to break our backs!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-663963122": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1833861905,
   "actor": "Kirby",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "And if you can’t believe in this farm anymore… then maybe you don’t belong here either!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1006112691": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1833861905,
   "actor": "Clay",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "Maybe you're right...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
   "onStart": [
    {
     "kind": "setActive",
     "type": "InstructionGameObjectSetActive",
     "title": "Set Active Raise_Stat_Charm to True",
     "fields": {
      "m_Active": {
       "kind": "value",
